            "name": "Basher Beatdown",
            "steam_appid": 617920,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617920/extras/1b14e2280cd65256b77ab2ac55a36c42.poster.avif?t=1791977450\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617920/extras/1b14e2280cd65256b77ab2ac55a36c42.webm?t=1791977450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617920/extras/1b14e2280cd65256b77ab2ac55a36c42.mp4?t=1791977450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The arena's centerpiece is a giant beast, and it's hungry. In Basher Beatdown you can't just knock your friends out. You have to drag, throw, or launch them straight into its waiting jaws. It's a fast, funny, fully physics driven brawl where the floor is chaos and the monster is always winning.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Feed them to the beast</strong>: the only way to score. Dash to stun a rival, scoop them up before they recover, and hurl them into the beast's mouth. Throw crates and bombs too, or raise your shield to bounce it all right back.<br></li><li><strong>Everything is physics</strong>: the whole game, your character included, runs on a physics simulation. It stays tight and predictable even as the arena descends into total mayhem.<br></li><li><strong>Arenas full of surprises</strong>: dodge erupting geysers, exploding swamp flowers, lightning strikes and lava updrafts, or survive a shifting ruin that rebuilds itself mid match. Every stage brings its own hazard.<br></li><li><strong>Bend the rules</strong>: battle through modes from last one standing to timed score runs and team fights, then tweak gravity, mass, throw force and more with a deep set of physics mutators. Flip on Chaos Mode to randomize everything at once.<br></li><li><strong>Couch or online</strong>: brawl in the same room or match up online, and drop in bots across a range of difficulties to practice solo or fill out any lobby.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617920/extras/1b14e2280cd65256b77ab2ac55a36c42.poster.avif?t=1791977450\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617920/extras/1b14e2280cd65256b77ab2ac55a36c42.webm?t=1791977450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617920/extras/1b14e2280cd65256b77ab2ac55a36c42.mp4?t=1791977450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The arena's centerpiece is a giant beast, and it's hungry. In Basher Beatdown you can't just knock your friends out. You have to drag, throw, or launch them straight into its waiting jaws. It's a fast, funny, fully physics driven brawl where the floor is chaos and the monster is always winning.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Feed them to the beast</strong>: the only way to score. Dash to stun a rival, scoop them up before they recover, and hurl them into the beast's mouth. Throw crates and bombs too, or raise your shield to bounce it all right back.<br></li><li><strong>Everything is physics</strong>: the whole game, your character included, runs on a physics simulation. It stays tight and predictable even as the arena descends into total mayhem.<br></li><li><strong>Arenas full of surprises</strong>: dodge erupting geysers, exploding swamp flowers, lightning strikes and lava updrafts, or survive a shifting ruin that rebuilds itself mid match. Every stage brings its own hazard.<br></li><li><strong>Bend the rules</strong>: battle through modes from last one standing to timed score runs and team fights, then tweak gravity, mass, throw force and more with a deep set of physics mutators. Flip on Chaos Mode to randomize everything at once.<br></li><li><strong>Couch or online</strong>: brawl in the same room or match up online, and drop in bots across a range of difficulties to practice solo or fill out any lobby.</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "A fast paced multiplayer physics brawler where knocking out rivals isn't enough. You feed them to the hungry beasts that guard each arena. Brawl online or on the couch, across a range of stages and modes, with friends or bots.",
